WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.730
Taking your blood pressure tablets the right way helps them work best.

00:05.230 --> 00:11.070
Take them at the same time every day. Link it to a daily habit, like brushing your teeth.

00:11.570 --> 00:17.560
Don't stop your tablets when your readings look normal. Normal readings mean the tablets are working.

00:18.060 --> 00:25.480
If you miss a dose, take it when you remember, unless it's nearly time for the next one. Never take two doses together.

00:25.980 --> 00:33.300
Ask your doctor before taking painkillers or cold medicines. Some of them can raise blood pressure.
